	"descriptionMarkdown": "This is Destiny.\nVersion 2.0:\n- adjusted asteroid collectors for better ammo optimalization\n- added 2 more laser towers\n- added ON/OFF button for laser towers\n- added indicators for ammo buffer\n- remade engines/fuel controller\nStarship properties:\nSize: 93(w)x117(h)\nWeight: 884t\nCargo: 18x\nThrusters: 5x\nTanks: 100K\nEnergy: 13.3MW / 380MJ\nTurrets: 11x top,10x sides,6x rear-> 27x total + 5x top laser\n\nIt's self sustain and prevents any overloads of collectors.\nShip contains controller where engines efficiency can be set.\nShip contains indicator system for levels of energy,fuel,water and ammo.\nShip contains blinking navigation lights.\nIn future it can be upgraded for nuclear power.\n\n© Designed by Velda\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@VeldaGames/\n\nThrusters control on this ship is by decider combinator connected to fuel pumps. On the pumps you set number from 0-99. 99 means 99% efficiency, 50 means 50% efficiency etc. 97% is default and optimal for lowest fuel consumption, but also low speed.",
